    "text": "By James Thorp ,\n9 hours ago The Fed wants to hear from you. One year after the GENIUS Act became law, the Federal Reserve is formally asking the public to weigh in on two new proposals aimed squarely at stablecoin issuers — and the request comes with an awkward backdrop: regulators already missed their own deadline. Read full article",
